Apply the recipe over pre-existing config instead of hard-failing.

Mirrors the (unreleased) 1.3.x commit on the amazeeio_umami_search project:
core defaults recipe config to strict: true, which aborts when config in the
recipe's config/ directory (e.g. the recipe_finder_assistant) already exists
with different content. The demo pre-installs a newer agent-based assistant
and chatbot block, so existing config must be left untouched.
Drop this patch once amazeeio_umami_search > 1.3.0 is released.

--- a/recipe.yml
+++ b/recipe.yml
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ install:
   - search_api
   - search_api_db
 config:
+  strict: false
   actions:
     search_api.server.umami_recipe_server:
       setupVdbServerWithDefaults:
